# P1 hardening ن-8 (docs/p1-hardening-plan.md §5-ب): normalize this repo to
# LF everywhere. The repo had no .gitattributes at all and had drifted to a
# mix -- 56 of 701 tracked files carried CR -- because git on the Windows
# side of \\wsl.localhost\ and git inside WSL disagree about line endings,
# and core.autocrlf is unset in WSL. One automated edit in step 11 turned 17
# test files into a 7444-line diff with zero semantic change because of it.
#
# Every git command in this repo must still be run from inside WSL (that
# note explains why: the \\wsl.localhost\ share does not carry git metadata
# faithfully). This file makes LF the rule for the index too, instead of
# depending on every tool that touches the tree to behave.
* text=auto eol=lf
